{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/2/952683d3523002b8978e6742566ffad2aab7d6ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{*}$\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83dacecc3f852b6d1fc31accf43e249930c0b27f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"13\" height=\"37\" />, the reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.  For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/483740d76f87de0f2e9727f83f5638d0a0b9586d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{*}=\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"52\" height=\"37\" />.  How many of the following statements are true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cca0cd3fcd3620a8752c1c6892f4e5f61060862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{2em}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"2\" />i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5dbd5398d087db765a1ebc264632e7b1edf4a922.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^*+6^*=9^*$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cca0cd3fcd3620a8752c1c6892f4e5f61060862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{2em}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"2\" />ii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/1/a1170d0be15926eb949a41edbaa982574a406f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^*-4^*=2^*$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cca0cd3fcd3620a8752c1c6892f4e5f61060862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{2em}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"2\" />iii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/3/c231d5d41efe269258c4c94028b8957c116fab84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^*\\cdot 6^*=12^*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"95\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cca0cd3fcd3620a8752c1c6892f4e5f61060862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{2em}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"2\" />iv) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601e444dd54a7fe79ac404f699728de5313a469c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^*\\div 2^* =5^*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/4/ba4822a38fc52b22a7f0880bbc9eb46cb9dd9760.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Statement (i) is false, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d93495a9597afe049010ac9715a6e6dd270a50fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{2} \\neq \\frac{1}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Statement (ii) is false, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7c8c2aa4952b18c552ed5ebf9c8042a71975d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{1}{4} = -\\frac{1}{12} \\neq \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"148\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Statement (iii) is true, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3ad7223f6792736658adb7f7cb918c87c50ad484.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Statement (iv) is true, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/0/be077eab68be7cc98d69b91876ec0310d66f9643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10}\\div \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adefec827068fcce8470f84eb8444d1848f285a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> of these statements are true.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">P